   "text": "## 📦 Release: matrix-e2ee-cli 0.3.0\n\n**What changed** for @alice:example.org and everyone in #ops:example.org:\n\n- *Markdown* in messages, rendered as HTML\n- Mentions: ping bob directly\n  - nested item with `inline code`\n  * nested star item\n    + deeper plus item\n- ~~removed~~ the old flag\n\n| Area | Before | After |\n|:-----|:------:|------:|\n| send | plain | **HTML** |\n| edit | plain | *HTML* |\n\nUpgrade with:\n```sh\ncargo install --locked matrix-e2ee-cli\necho \"done\" && exit 0\n```\n\nDetails: https://github.com/example/tool/pull/42, fix https://github.com/example/tool/commit/0123abcd\nand [the changelog](https://example.org/changelog#0.3.0).",
   "mentions": [
    "@bob:example.org"
   ],
   "html": "<h2>📦 Release: matrix-e2ee-cli 0.3.0</h2><strong>What changed</strong> for <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/@alice:example.org\">@alice:example.org</a> and everyone in <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#ops:example.org\">#ops:example.org</a>:<ul><li><em>Markdown</em> in messages, rendered as HTML</li><li>Mentions: ping <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/@bob:example.org\">bob</a> directly</li><li>nested item with <code>inline code</code></li><li>nested star item</li><li>deeper plus item</li><li><del>removed</del> the old flag</li></ul><table><tr><th>Area</th><th>Before</th><th>After</th></tr><tr><td>send</td><td>plain</td><td><strong>HTML</strong></td></tr><tr><td>edit</td><td>plain</td><td><em>HTML</em></td></tr></table>Upgrade with:<br><pre><code class=\"language-sh\">cargo install --locked matrix-e2ee-cli\necho &quot;done&quot; &amp;&amp; exit 0\n</code></pre><br>Details: <a href=\"https://github.com/example/tool/pull/42\">example/tool#42</a>, fix <a href=\"https://github.com/example/tool/commit/0123abcd\">example/tool@0123abcd</a><br>and <a href=\"https://example.org/changelog#0.3.0\">the changelog</a>."
