   "text": "## Postmortem: proxy outage\n**Impact:** 14 minutes, *all* sites behind the proxy.\n**Cause:** a config line `listen 443 ssl;` was missing; see [runbook](https://wiki.example.org/proxy(v2)).\n\n### Timeline\n| Time | Event |\n|------|-------|\n| 10:02 | alert fired |\n| 10:16 | fix deployed by @erin:example.org |\n\n### Config before\n```\nserver {\n    # listen 443 ssl;   <- missing\n    server_name example.org;\n}\n```\n### Follow-ups\n- [ ] add a check\n- [x] restore service\n> \"Never again\" - the team",
   "mentions": [],
   "html": "<h2>Postmortem: proxy outage</h2><strong>Impact:</strong> 14 minutes, <em>all</em> sites behind the proxy.<br><strong>Cause:</strong> a config line <code>listen 443 ssl;</code> was missing; see <a href=\"https://wiki.example.org/proxy(v2)\">runbook</a>.<h3>Timeline</h3><table><tr><th>Time</th><th>Event</th></tr><tr><td>10:02</td><td>alert fired</td></tr><tr><td>10:16</td><td>fix deployed by <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/@erin:example.org\">@erin:example.org</a></td></tr></table><h3>Config before</h3><pre><code>server {\n    # listen 443 ssl;   &lt;- missing\n    server_name example.org;\n}\n</code></pre><h3>Follow-ups</h3><ul><li>[ ] add a check</li><li>[x] restore service</li></ul><blockquote>&quot;Never again&quot; - the team</blockquote>"
